  "notes": "A compound of {使用|しよう} (use) + {中|ちゅう} (during). Functions as a status indicator meaning \"currently in use\" or \"occupied.\"\n\nUSAGE:\n- トイレ/お{手洗|てあら}い: restroom (the most common context)\n- {会議室|かいぎしつ}: meeting rooms\n- コピー{機|き}: copy machines\n- {更衣室|こういしつ}: changing rooms\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {使用中|しようちゅう}の{表示|ひょうじ}: \"in use\" indicator\n- {使用中|しようちゅう}になる: to become occupied\n- {使用中|しようちゅう}のランプ: \"in use\" light\n\nRELATED 〜{中|ちゅう} EXPRESSIONS:\n- {故障中|こしょうちゅう}: out of order\n- {営業中|えいぎょうちゅう}: open for business\n- {準備中|じゅんびちゅう}: in preparation / closed for setup\n- {清掃中|せいそうちゅう}: being cleaned\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {空|あ}き/{空室|くうしつ}: vacant, available",
